  "releaseNotes": "# AID v2.1.1\n\n## 中文更新说明\n\n### 新增\n\n- 接入 DeepSeek V4.1 Flash，支持文本与图片理解、流式、思考档位、JSON 输出、客户端工具续轮、对话前缀续写和非思考 FIM 补全；补齐模型能力、前置校验及缓存 Token 计费。\n- 后台增加对话前缀续写能力开关，保存时保留其他能力及扩展配置。\n\n### 修复\n\n- 更新开源 README 产品预览，补齐当前用户创作工作流、流程画布、模型编排、在线升级与运行监控界面截图。\n- 补齐风格推荐、排序字段与分类关系，修复风格列表和详情报错；保留已有风格配置。\n- 补齐案例广场作品审核、发布管理菜单及操作权限项，保留已有菜单和角色授权。\n- 升级器自更新后由新进程核验目标版本并结束重启状态；版本不符明确报告失败，不再把“正在重启”保留为最终成功文案。\n- 修复模型能力编码解析歧义、嵌套消息类型丢失及思考别名保存问题。\n- 修复固定图片尺寸与一致展示比例误判、模型能力投影返回无效默认规格的问题。\n- 缩短分镜视频参考素材导入文案，并修复流程化创作对话输入区在未挂载装饰样式时发送按钮定位失效的问题。\n\n### 兼容性与升级注意事项\n\n- 在 v2.1.0 基础上执行 `sql/v2.1.1.sql`，升级前备份数据库及部署配置。SQL 可重复执行，新安装结构及数据已同步初始化脚本。\n- DeepSeek 新模型默认停用，不替换旧模型，不自动绑定业务池；配置凭证、核对价格及权限后再启用。\n- 新模型按固定高峰成本 SKU 计价，空闲时段费率仅作为资料保留，未自动切换。Files 等替代入口不在本次接入范围。\n- 普通管理角色需要按需授权新增菜单；不自动扩大已有角色权限。\n- 升级器终态修复需要配套更新升级器，仅执行 SQL 不会改变升级器行为。\n\n## English Release Notes\n\n### Added\n\n- Added DeepSeek V4.1 Flash text and image understanding, streaming, reasoning levels, JSON output, client tool continuations, chat prefix completion and non-thinking FIM, with capability validation and cache-aware token billing.\n- Added the admin chat-prefix capability switch while preserving unrelated and extended configuration.\n\n### Fixed\n\n- Refreshed the open-source README preview with current creation workflows, flow canvas, model orchestration, online upgrade, and runtime-monitoring screenshots.\n- Restored missing style recommendation, sorting and category structures to prevent list/detail failures while retaining existing configuration.\n- Restored case-gallery review and publication-management menus and permission entries without replacing existing menu or role settings.\n- The restarted updater now verifies the target version before completing self-update; mismatches fail explicitly instead of leaving a restart message as the final success result.\n- Fixed ambiguous capability selection, lost nested message types, reasoning-alias saves, fixed-size aspect-ratio validation and invalid projected default settings.\n- Shortened the storyboard reference-import label and kept the flow-creation send action anchored when optional composer decoration is absent.\n\n### Compatibility and Upgrade Notes\n\n- Upgrade from v2.1.0 using the repeatable `sql/v2.1.1.sql` migration. Back up the database and deployment configuration first; fresh-install SQL includes the same changes.\n- The new DeepSeek model remains disabled until credentials, pricing, permissions and business-pool bindings are reviewed. Existing models are not replaced.\n- Billing uses fixed peak-price SKUs; off-peak rates are reference metadata only. Alternative Files/API entry points are not included.\n- Grant new admin menu permissions as needed. Update the updater binary to receive the self-update completion fix; SQL alone does not change updater behavior.",
